---
title: Frontend Structure
---
flowchart TB
    Browser([Browser]) --> Gate{Authenticated session?}
    Gate -->|no| Login[Sign in or create<br/>an invited profile]
    Login -->|one-time invitation<br/>or existing password| Auth[Authentication API]
    Auth -->|HttpOnly cookie| Gate
    Gate -->|yes| App[Private React application shell]
    Session[(Per-user conversation<br/>and presentation job IDs)] --> App
    App --> Restore[Navigation and owned-state restore]
    Restore --> Views[Chat · Memory · Artifacts · Presentations]
    Views --> Actions[Compose and upload<br/>inspect, revise and download]
    Actions --> Client[Typed API and SSE client<br/>validation and visible errors]
    Client --> Backend[FastAPI API<br/>session derives the owner]
    Backend -->|streams, polling and responses| Client
    Client --> Results[Answers, sources, tool status,<br/>artifacts, slides and progress]
    Results --> Views

    classDef shell fill:#f5f5f7,stroke:#86868b,color:#1d1d1f;
    classDef component fill:#e8f1fb,stroke:#5e8fc4,color:#102a43;
    classDef boundary fill:#eef7ee,stroke:#5f9562,color:#183b1b;
    classDef external fill:#f1edff,stroke:#8872c6,color:#2e2450;
    class Browser,Gate,App,Restore shell;
    class Login,Auth,Views,Actions,Results component;
    class Session,Client boundary;
    class Backend external;
